            <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-brand-red/10 rounded-lg border border-brand-red/20">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-red mb-1">Optional: Red Button</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-700">WhatsApp-Zugang – Antwort in max. 3 Stunden, meistens innerhalb von 15 Minuten.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-4">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-navy mb-2">Format:</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">1-2 Tage, 4-6 Stunden, 11:00–17:00 Uhr (auch Wochenend-Termine möglich) – Online oder vor Ort</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-4">+ 2x jährlich 30 Min 1:1-Session</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-6">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-navy mb-2">Investition:</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Auf Anfrage</p>
              <a href="https://tally.so/r/Y5PdoB" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-brand-red text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-redDark transition-colors">
